{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"pascal","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Pascal and Delphi","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Pascal and Delphi (.pas .pp .dpr .lpr).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"pascal","name":"Pascal and Delphi","extensions":[".pas",".pp",".dpr",".lpr",".inc"],"grammar":"grammars/pascal.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["{","}"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Pascal and Delphi","path":"snippets/pascal.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/pascal.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": true,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\{\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\(\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\)\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:implementation|initialization|resourcestring|finalization|constructor|destructor|inherited|interface|procedure|protected|published|threadvar|function|property|exports|finally|library|private|program|downto|except|inline|object|packed|public|record|repeat|string|array|begin|class|const|label|raise|until|while|case|else|file|goto|then|type|unit|uses|with|and|asm|div|end|for|mod|nil|not|out|set|shl|shr|try|var|xor|as|do|if|in|is|of|on|or|to)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|nil)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:cardinal|integer|boolean|longint|pointer|tobject|string|double|char|real|byte|word)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:setlength|assigned|writeln|dispose|readln|length|write|read|inc|dec|new)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/pascal.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Program\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"prog\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"program ${1:Name};\",\n      \"\",\n      \"begin\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end.\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A program\"\n  },\n  \"Procedure\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"proc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"procedure ${1:Name}(${2:args});\",\n      \"begin\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A procedure\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"func\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"function ${1:Name}(${2:args}): ${3:Integer};\",\n      \"begin\",\n      \"\\tResult := $0;\",\n      \"end;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"For loop\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"for\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"for ${1:i} := 1 to ${2:n} do\",\n      \"begin\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A for loop\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Pascal and Delphi\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Pascal and Delphi.\n\n## Files\n\n`.pas`, `.pp`, `.dpr`, `.lpr`, `.inc`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `prog` | A program |\n| `proc` | A procedure |\n| `func` | A function |\n| `for` | A for loop |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}